  "description": "The Vaporesso Vibe SE Pod Kit delivers a flexible, high-performance vaping experience in a slim, pocket-sized format. Designed for vapers who want simplicity without sacrificing control, this smart pod device features a built-in 1100mAh battery, USB-C fast charging, and a manual power mode selector to fine-tune your vape. At the core of the Vibe SE is Vaporesso’s dual mesh Smart Pod system, which houses two coil resistances (0.6ohm and 0.8ohm) within a single 2ml refillable pod. Slide the on-device switch to toggle between Eco Mode (14W, 0.8ohm) and Power Mode (24W, 0.6ohm), allowing you to customise your vapour production and flavour intensity without needing to swap pods. The built-in AXON chipset automatically adjusts the pod’s airflow and coil configuration based on your selected mode. This intelligent design supports both MTL (mouth-to-lung) and RDTL (restricted direct-to-lung) styles, making it ideal for use with 50/50 freebase or nicotine salt e-liquids . Vaporesso’s Hyperflow mesh structure enhances vapour consistency and flavour clarity, while the transparent pod design ensures easy liquid monitoring. Lightweight, fast-charging and packed with clever features, the Vaporesso Vibe SE is a versatile pod vape kit built for smooth flavour and total convenience. Check out our e-liquid range and choose the best fit for your vape kit setup. Please Note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Pods, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming’ simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
